080010ac <HAL_PWREx_EnableOverDrive>:
  *         During the Over-drive switch activation, no peripheral clocks should be enabled.   
  *         The peripheral clocks must be enabled once the Over-drive mode is activated.   
  * @retval HAL status
  */
